        <mxCell id="enc_bar" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;fontColor=#555555;" value="At Rest: SSE-KMS (customer-managed keys)  |  In Transit: TLS 1.2 (JDBC SSL + S3 HTTPS)  |  Logs: CloudWatch (encrypted)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="18" width="770" x="80" y="940" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="reload_title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=5;align=center;" value="Failure Reload Mechanism" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="18" width="330" x="163" y="1005" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="reload_detail" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;fontStyle=0;align=left;fontColor=#333333;verticalAlign=top;" value="1. Auto-retry: MaxRetries=2 per job (30s backoff built into Glue)&#xa;2. Partial failure: try/except per table inside each job — healthy tables still process&#xa;3. Manual rerun: trigger workflow via Glue Console for any date&#xa;4. Backfill: pass --start-date / --end-date params to workflow → jobs read date range&#xa;5. Rollback: Delta Lake time travel (RESTORE TABLE AS OF version) — 30-day retention&#xa;6. Idempotent: Delta merge (upsert) = re-running same day produces same result, no duplicates" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="580" x="64" y="1029" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="svc_title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=5;align=center;" value="AWS Services (7 total — no external tools)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="18" width="350" x="1100" y="640" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="svc_list" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;align=left;fontColor=#333333;verticalAlign=top;" value="1. RDS SQL Server — source database&lt;br&gt;2. Amazon S3 — data lake (Bronze/Silver/Gold)&lt;br&gt;3. AWS Glue (PySpark) — all ETL jobs&lt;br&gt;4. AWS Glue Workflow — orchestration + scheduling&lt;br&gt;5. Amazon Athena — serverless SQL on Gold&lt;br&gt;6. Amazon SNS — failure email alerts&lt;br&gt;7. AWS KMS — encryption key management&lt;div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="320" x="1100" y="665" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
